{"data":{"id":9572,"title":"Bài Tập 4: Tạo Discovery Server và chuyển Config Server sang Git backend","description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài Tập 4: Tạo Discovery Server và chuyển Config Server sang Git backend</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cấp độ: Vận dụng chuyên sâu | Tổng hợp kiến thức Session 02 &amp; 03</span></i></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1. Mục tiêu kiến thức</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Xây dựng Discovery Server (Eureka Server) để quản lý đăng ký và khám phá dịch vụ.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Chuyển Config Server từ native profile sang Git backend (GitHub repository).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Đăng ký tất cả Microservice lên Eureka Server.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hiểu luồng khởi động đúng thứ tự: Config Server → Discovery Server → các Microservice.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2. Tình huống nghiệp vụ</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hệ thống MediCare đã có Config Server hoạt động với native profile (Bài tập 3). Tuy nhiên, đội phát triển nhận ra 2 vấn đề:</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Vấn đề 1 — Config native không version control:&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">File cấu hình nằm trong resources của dự án Config Server, không có lịch sử thay đổi. Khi ai đó sửa sai cấu hình, không thể rollback về phiên bản trước.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Vấn đề 2 — Các service không biết nhau:&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Khi Appointment Service muốn gọi sang Patient Service, nó phải hard-code URL http://localhost:8081. Nếu Patient Service đổi port hoặc chạy trên server khác, Appointment Service ngay lập tức bị lỗi.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Giải pháp: (1) Chuyển Config Server sang Git backend để có version control. (2) Tạo Discovery Server (Eureka) để các service tự đăng ký và tìm thấy nhau qua tên service thay vì hard-code URL.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3. Yêu cầu của bài tập</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu 1 — Tạo GitHub repository cho config files:</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tạo một repository mới trên GitHub, ví dụ: medicare-config-repo.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Push 5 file cấu hình (patient-service.yml, doctor-service.yml, appointment-service.yml, medical-record-service.yml, pharmacy-service.yml) lên repository này.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nội dung các file giống config-repo/ ở Bài tập 3, bổ sung thêm cấu hình Eureka Client cho từng service.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ví dụ file patient-service.yml trên GitHub (bổ sung cấu hình Eureka):</span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:28.35pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">server:</span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:28.35pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;port: 8081</span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:28.35pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:#f2f2f2;line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:28.35pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;w